  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "1. Open **Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules** and turn on **Allow Online Appointment Booking**.\n2. Go to **Scheduling > Visit Types**, pick each routine visit you want patients to book, and check **Available Online**.\n3. Then open **Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability** and select only the doctors who should accept online requests.\n4. Make sure each selected provider’s schedule template is published and their rooms are active under **Settings > Facility > Rooms** so they will appear to patients."
}
